        <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;flowchart TB\n\n\n%% ==========================\n%% USER\n%% ==========================\n\nA[\&quot;Business User&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Creates and manages agents\&quot;]\n\n\n\n%% ==========================\n%% DASHBOARD\n%% ==========================\n\nB[\&quot;SaaS Dashboard&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Next.js Frontend&lt;br/&gt;Agent Builder UI\&quot;]\n\n\n\n%% ==========================\n%% API\n%% ==========================\n\nC[\&quot;Agent Management API&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;FastAPI&lt;br/&gt;CRUD operations&lt;br/&gt;Agent control\&quot;]\n\n\n\n%% ==========================\n%% CONFIGURATION\n%% ==========================\n\nD[\&quot;Agent Configuration Service&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Stores agent definition&lt;br/&gt;Business rules\&quot;]\n\n\nE[\&quot;Prompt Management&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;System instructions&lt;br/&gt;Personality&lt;br/&gt;Behavior rules\&quot;]\n\n\nF[\&quot;Voice Configuration&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Voice selection&lt;br/&gt;Language&lt;br/&gt;Speaking style\&quot;]\n\n\nG[\&quot;Tool Configuration&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Available tools&lt;br/&gt;Permissions&lt;br/&gt;API connections\&quot;]\n\n\nH[\&quot;Knowledge Configuration&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;RAG sources&lt;br/&gt;Documents&lt;br/&gt;Retrieval settings\&quot;]\n\n\n\n%% ==========================\n%% VERSIONING\n%% ==========================\n\nI[\&quot;Agent Version Management&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Versions&lt;br/&gt;Changes&lt;br/&gt;History\&quot;]\n\n\n\n%% ==========================\n%% TESTING\n%% ==========================\n\nJ[\&quot;Agent Testing Environment&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Simulation&lt;br/&gt;Playground&lt;br/&gt;Validation\&quot;]\n\n\n\n%% ==========================\n%% DEPLOYMENT\n%% ==========================\n\nK[\&quot;Deployment Service&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Publish agent&lt;br/&gt;Assign runtime&lt;br/&gt;Manage status\&quot;]\n\n\n\nL[\&quot;Agent Runtime&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;LiveKit Workers&lt;br/&gt;LangGraph&lt;br/&gt;Tools\&quot;]\n\n\n\n%% ==========================\n%% OPERATIONS\n%% ==========================\n\nM[\&quot;Monitoring&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Performance&lt;br/&gt;Errors&lt;br/&gt;Usage\&quot;]\n\n\nN[\&quot;Rollback Management&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Previous versions&lt;br/&gt;Recovery\&quot;]\n\n\n\n%% ==========================\n%% FLOW\n%% ==========================\n\n\nA --&gt; B\n\nB --&gt; C\n\nC --&gt; D\n\nD --&gt; E\nD --&gt; F\nD --&gt; G\nD --&gt; H\n\nD --&gt; I\n\nI --&gt; J\n\nJ --&gt; K\n\nK --&gt; L\n\nL --&gt; M\n\nM --&gt; N\n\nN --&gt; I&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="ySirkflwYDD05Z-J9VoX-617">
